+--       - item_cover_candidates: submitted_by_user_id -> NULL, file moved to cover-candidates/retained/<candidate id>.<ext>, owner cleared, user id scrubbed from
+--         moderation_metadata and rejection_reason. status, display_eligible, is_primary, selected_as_cover_at and every other visibility field are NEVER touched, so a
